[{"id":165451079,"discussion_id":"91db7222715cc7878242c061f996d749da6f5215","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-basic/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| conversion/im2col | ✅ [*songkai111*](https://gitcode.com/songkai111), [*wangrui_*](https://gitcode.com/wangrui_) (2/2) | ✅ [*songkai111*](https://gitcode.com/songkai111) (1/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n pengyiming7, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-03-17T09:34:43+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-17T14:10:37+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165451093,"discussion_id":"6eedccab9d98088807a98b14aef0718bbf9e1572","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-17T09:34:48+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-17T09:34:48+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165451187,"discussion_id":"7cac22071f113b1ca6d178f9a85b10abfc9b659f","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR主要优化了im2col算子在处理带padding场景时的内存安全性和性能。原实现中，输入缓冲区大小未按内存块对齐，在边界补零时可能导致内存访问越界或性能下降。本次修改通过统一缓冲区对齐，解决了此潜在风险，提升了算子在填充场景下的稳定性和执行效率。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n核心修改包括：1) 在类中定义`BLOCK_SIZE`常量作为统一对齐基准；2) 在`Init`函数中将输入缓冲区大小向上对齐至`BLOCK_SIZE`，并存储对齐后的元素数量`inputElemNum_`；3) 将后续多个数据处理函数（如`PadInWInH`）中硬编码的缓冲区大小引用，统一替换为使用对齐后的`inputElemNum_`，确保内存访问一致且安全。此外，根据模板参数`isPadding`适配不同的缓冲区初始化策略。","created_at":"2026-03-17T09:35:25+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-17T09:35:25+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165451765,"discussion_id":"804760c490bc4e606de202fd275bf425a76a3cd2","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-03-17T09:37:58+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-17T09:37:58+08:00","user":{"id":"6822d30c60184036954b14e1","login":"pengyiming7","object_id":"6822d30c60184036954b14e1","name":"pengyiming7","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/pengyiming7"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165451768,"discussion_id":"cc6701fa7fd1e40f339615df2c51a9355598ab02","body":"/lgtm","created_at":"2026-03-17T09:37:59+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-17T09:37:59+08:00","user":{"id":"6822d21660184036954b1468","login":"wangrui_","object_id":"6822d21660184036954b1468","name":"RuiWang_","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/wangrui_"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165451957,"discussion_id":"9b7cb3a89cc49a57152db7cf65260b57906c7383","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [